TIP:  You can just play (G) and (C) and skip the (Gadd) and (CaddG) if you wish.  In both cases all you’re doing is adding your pinky to the 1st string/3rd fret to accentuate the treble <e> to go along with Vince and Patty’s high notes.
     
TIP:  If transposing, play the root of the transposed (Gadd) and (CaddG) and add the 5th notes as needed.


